graphify-out/

# impeccable design hook — machine-local state only.
# `.impeccable/config.json` (shared detector config: ignoreRules/Files/Values) is
# intentionally NOT ignored, so triage decisions travel with the repo.
# `**/` wajib: .impeccable/ hidup di multi-step-form/, sedangkan pola ber-slash
# di .gitignore terikat ke direktori .gitignore-nya — bentuk tanpa `**/` tidak
# pernah cocok dan kedua berkas lokal ini akan ikut ter-commit di clone baru.
**/.impeccable/hook.cache.json
**/.impeccable/config.local.json
